      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "8/14/2022: Update, I did submit a report ticket to EAC 2 weeks ago. they have not responded.\nI've also found out that even when the application is not running vrc will still pick up the dll a couple hours into a play session and randomly quit the game. Kind of odd behavior.\nThere are multiple folk from club worlds that have expressed to me they cant run their clubs anymore because they where using this as their backbone. Note for those people, you can use voice meter in place of via, its just more complicated and has a really bad UI.\nI've tried the current Beta w_2022.2.2p3 and Dante seems to be working fine, however when EAC picked it up it usually took a little bit of time to do so. will see what happens after it goes live.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
